demos/lurpic_studio/studio/testdata/
/render/vulkan/crates/lurpic_render/target/
# Testdata dirs are ignored so generated *_actual.png and scratch files stay
# out — but the GOLDEN fixtures (testdata/golden/**.png) are the expected
# outputs and MUST be tracked: golden tests fail in CI without them.
# New/regenerated goldens: `git add -f <path>` (tracked goldens then commit
# normally; only new files need -f).
marks/**/**/testdata/

*_actual.png
.claude
.codex
.windsurf
# The Android pipeline is deferred: it needs the NDK/SDK and emulator and has
# never run. Tracked host CI lives in the ROOT .github (ci.yml, dependabot.yml,
# CODEOWNERS); only the deferred workflow stays ignored.
# See devdocs/plans/host-ci-gate.md (NG-1/D1) for the follow-on slice.
.github/workflows/android.yml
# ...but nested .github dirs inside vendored crates / bundled static assets
# stay ignored (they are third-party metadata, not ours). Anchored patterns,
# so the root .github above is unaffected.
render/vulkan/crates/lurpic_render/vendor/**/.github/
assets/static-default/**/.github/
.tools
.zcode
*.test
/lurpic_studio
devdocs/
/vendor/
